OL,3,GNEWSAWoolly mammoths and a Victorian
OL,4,Aclink among heritage on show
OL,5,
OL,6,FWoolly mammoths, a 19th Century clink,
OL,7,Fand a children's farm are among sights
OL,8,Fpeople can see for free as part of a
OL,9,Fheritage and culture festival in the
OL,10,FWest Midlands.
OL,12,FVolunteers and organisations are
OL,13,Fpreparing to open the doors of dozens
OL,14,Fof Heritage Open Day venues across the
OL,15,Fregion between 11-20 September.
OL,17,FThe annual event, organised by the
OL,18,FNational Trust with Postcode Lottery,
OL,19,Fcelebrates hidden histories on people's
OL,20,Fdoorstep and includes places that would
OL,21,Fnot normally allow public access, or
OL,22,Fnormally charge.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
